يدعونكِ بالحسّاسة الضعيفة

9
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,250
هذا أمرٌ حسَن

10
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:31,150
ماذا؟

11
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,320
سورا، أنتِ حنونة جدّاً

12
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,010
ناديتِني "سورا" أخيراً

13
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,020
أنتِ سورا بالطبع، صحيح؟

14
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,120
سورا

15
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,270
أريد مزيداً من كرات اللّحم خاصّتكِ

16
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:49,000
!حسناً

17
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,000
...الجميع

18
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,170
!سورا-سان

19
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,340
!تبّاً! سورا، تعالي

20
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,010
Stay shigachi na image darake no

21
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,010
My wings are full of images
of holding back

22
00:01:01,930 --> 00:01:06,400
tayorinai tsubasa demo kitto toberusa

23
00:01:01,930 --> 00:01:06,400
They are still weak
but I'm sure I can fly

24
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:11,610
On my love

25
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:19,830
gokigen na chou ni natte
kirameku kaze ni notte

26
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:19,830
I become a happy butterfly
and fly on the shimmering wind

27
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:24,120
imasugu kimi ni ai ni ikou

28
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:24,120
And I will go to see you
right away

29
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:31,000
yokeina koto nante wasureta hou ga mashisa

30
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:31,000
Better you forget
about unnecessary things

31
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:34,800
kore ijou syareteru jikan wa nai

32
00:01:31,130 --> 00:01:34,800
There's no time
to joke anymore

33
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:42,010
nani ga wow wow wow wow wow
kono sora ni todoku no darou

34
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:42,010
I wonder
what will reach the sky

35
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:49,810
dakedo wow wow wow wow wow
ashita no yotei mo wakaranai

36
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:49,810
But don't even have
a plan for tomorrow

37
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:57,030
mugendai na yume no ato no
nanimo nai yononaka ja

38
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:57,030
Living in the world of nothing
after the infinite dream

39
00:01:57,150 --> 00:02:01,990
sousa itoshii omoi mo makesou ni narukedo

40
00:01:57,150 --> 00:02:01,990
My love to you
is growing weak

41
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:05,660
Stay shigachi na image darake no

42
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:05,660
My wings are holding back

43
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,540
tayorinai tsubasa demo kitto toberusa

44
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,540
They are still weak
but I'm sure I can fly

45
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:15,670
On my love

46
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:34,500
البشر مثيرون جدّاً للشفقة لأنّهم يعيشون
خوفاً من الموت

47
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:36,380
